## {{npmName}}@{{npmVersion}}

Stark Bank Node.js SDK — auto-generated from the OpenAPI 3.1 spec via [OpenAPI Generator](https://openapi-generator.tech) (`typescript-axios`). The generated client uses [axios](https://github.com/axios/axios) and can run in Node.js, Webpack or Browserify, in both CommonJS and ES6 module systems.

### Building

```
npm install
npm run build
```

### Publishing

Build the package, then run `npm publish`.

### Consuming

```
npm install {{npmName}}@{{npmVersion}} --save
```

### Usage

```typescript
import { Configuration, TransactionsApi } from "{{npmName}}";

const configuration = new Configuration({
  basePath: "https://api.starkbank.com",
});

const transactionsApi = new TransactionsApi(configuration);

const { data } = await transactionsApi.queryTransaction(10);
console.log(data);
```

Every resource in the spec (Transaction, Invoice, Transfer, ...) has a matching `*Api` class in `api/` and model types in `models/`, generated 1:1 from the OpenAPI paths and schemas — see `index.ts` for the full export list.
